{"title":"Antlion","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 19 Antlion that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 4 times (1.5% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/antlion\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/antlion?lv=18\">Lv 18 <span>242</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/antlion?lv=19\">Lv 19 <span>239</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/antlion?lv=20\">Lv 20 <span>115</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/antlion?lv=21\">Lv 21 <span>10</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/antlion?lv=22\">Lv 22 <span>4</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/antlion?lv=18\" title=\"Pick level 18\"><td><b>18</b></td><td>57</td><td>14.4</td><td>900</td><td class=\"muted\">171 · 20.2 · 2,700</td><td>242</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Colossus%20Ruins\">Colossus Ruins</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/antlion?lv=19\" title=\"Pick level 19\"><td><b>19</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>61</td><td>15</td><td>950</td><td class=\"muted\">183 · 21 · 2,850</td><td>239</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Colossus%20Ruins\">Colossus Ruins</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/antlion?lv=20\" title=\"Pick level 20\"><td><b>20</b></td><td>66</td><td>15.5</td><td>1,000</td><td class=\"muted\">198 · 21.7 · 3,000</td><td>115</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Outrider%20Camp\">Outrider Camp</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/antlion\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>21</b></td><td>70</td><td>16.1</td><td>1,050</td><td class=\"muted\">210 · 22.5 · 3,150</td><td>10</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/antlion?lv=22\" title=\"Pick level 22\"><td><b>22</b></td><td>74</td><td>16.6</td><td>1,100</td><td class=\"muted\">222 · 23.2 · 3,300</td><td>4</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 28 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"chitin-plate\" title=\"Chitin Plate - in 17 of 28 looted corpses, 15 recorded drops, 25 total, 1–4 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/e7a114aeae3b63b5e56d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Chitin Plate</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.6<br>×1–4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"antlion-mandible\" title=\"Antlion Mandible - in 16 of 28 looted corpses, 15 recorded drops, 19 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/3af9398e31b21e1c0d76.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Antlion Mandible</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.8<br>×1–2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" t